42852 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A Deployment box, flash-page, with replicas 2 and selector app flash-page, and a Service box, flash-page, port 80 to 8080, with the same selector. Arrows from both point to two Pod boxes, each labelled app flash-page. The Deployment's arrows say it keeps two Pods with this label; the Service's arrows say it sends traffic to Pods with this label. A footer says the three labels must match exactly, and a typo in one leaves the Service with no Pods to send to, with no error from Kubernetes.)/P 1015 0 R/Pg 910 0 R/K 45>>
endobj

